  ! #293: "If your configuration uses `title-description-and-issues`, `full`, or `issues`, update it to `title-and-description` to keep that behavior." - The old value and both aliases remain accepted and are interpreted as `title-and-description`, so existing configurations keep working without an update. The output incorrectly implies an update is needed to preserve behavior.
  ! #328: "You can rely on the listed package versions for this release." - The fact specifies the three dependency version updates, but the output lists no package versions to rely on.
  ! #301: "Commands now stop on unknown, repeated, or unsupported options" - Repeated single-value options are refused, but `--audience` remains repeatable. The output overstates the restriction by saying repeated options stop commands without this exception.

